  names no day for watching the video itself\, so doOn falls back to the 
 post’s own date (Monday night) and is flagged a guess\; the video is s
 till worth watching now if it was missed. The video did NOT come through
  the ParentSquare API — no attachment is listed on the post and fetch_
 attachments.py pulled nothing — so open the post in ParentSquare direc
 tly to play it. She gives no due date and no GradeCam link\, as expected
  under the daily-homework regime.\n\nOriginal post: https://www.parentsq
